  "issue": 481,
  "request": "Goal: Restore canonical upgrade-evidence recovery after stale test evidence invalidation.\nScope: Regenerate or safely reuse current-fingerprint upgrade evidence before impl-gate when upgrade-required source changes remain; record the decision and cover recovery cases. Preserve fail-closed handling of stale, missing, or malformed evidence.\nOut of scope: Relaxing upgrade-required detection, fail-open artifact handling, or repair manifest and ledger continuity handled by Issue #458.\nDescription: The stale recovery path deletes upgrade-result.json and its raw log, but no canonical owner recreates them before impl-gate. The flow must recover without requiring users to run senti upgrade manually, while avoiding unnecessary upgrades for changes that do not require one.",
